```uvl-code
Bicycle equipped with a groupset (Manufacturer is SRAM or Shimano), including various uses cases.
Gravel bike features wide tyres with some profile, while road bike has slim tyres with no profile. Both bikes are equipped with a drop bar handlebar.
Mountain bike is equipped with a flat handlebar. It also features extra wide tyres with deep profile.
It is also possible to fit the slim tyres on the gravel bike.
```